First we need to create the token using this Url
https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens

After generating the token we need to create the orgin link
git remote set-url origin https://francisvimalraj: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@github.com/francisvimalraj/gitTest.git
git remote set-url origin https://userName:githubToken@github.com/userName/reponame.git

git clone https://francisvimalraj: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@github.com/francisvimalraj/gitTest.git

git checkout -b new_test branch
will create the new branch

git checkout origin <branch_name>

Addd the new files the use this command to push the file on the remote

git add .
git commit -m "comment line for the commit"
git push <branch_name>

after fitst time push to the branch
use the command like this 

